OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused 'brutally' beat
OL,4,Afriend, trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was "brutally" attacked by a
OL,7,Fchildhood friend he had known for about
OL,8,F40 years, a murder trial has heard.
OL,10,FGraham Howard, 49, of Brook Street in
OL,11,FSyston, Leicestershire, is on trial at
OL,12,FLeicester Crown Court accused of
OL,13,Fkilling Simon Geary between 22 and 23
OL,14,FDecember 2025.
OL,16,FProsecutor Christopher Donnellan KC
OL,17,Ftold the court on Monday the pair had
OL,18,Fgone to drink alcohol at the
OL,19,Fdefendant's flat, and at about midnight
OL,20,FHoward "brutally and repeatedly hit
OL,21,Fhim, and when he was on the ground he
OL,22,Fstamped on him".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
