OL,4,Afriend, trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors were told they would hear
OL,7,Fevidence Howard had "delusional
OL,8,Fbeliefs" about Geary, and that he
OL,9,Fbelieved he was Ramzan Kadyrov, the
OL,10,Fleader of Chechnya, in Russia.
